{"version":1,"id":"daniel-caesar-who-knows","title":"Who Knows","artist":"Daniel Caesar","key":"Db","bpm":null,"bpmSource":"unknown","sourceUrl":"https://www.cifraclub.com.br/daniel-caesar/who-knows/?instrument=keyboard","instrument":"keyboard","lyrics":"included","timing":"estimated","timingModel":"qwen3.5:4b","credits":"Composed by: Justin Vernon, Matthew Burnett, Daniel Caesar, Rex Orange County, Romil Hemnani, Sir Dylan and Mustafa","chords":[{"symbol":"C#9","canonical":"C#add9","keyboardPitchClasses":[1,3,5],"interpretation":"Keyboard interpretation: C#add9"},{"symbol":"D#7(9)","canonical":"D#7(9)","keyboardPitchClasses":[3,5,7,10,1],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"F#7M","canonical":"F#maj7","keyboardPitchClasses":[6,10,1,5],"interpretation":"Keyboard interpretation: F#maj7"},{"symbol":"F#m7","canonical":"F#m7","keyboardPitchClasses":[6,9,1,4],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"C#","canonical":"C#","keyboardPitchClasses":[1,5,8],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"C#7M","canonical":"C#maj7","keyboardPitchClasses":[1,5,8,0],"interpretation":"Keyboard interpretation: C#maj7"},{"symbol":"C#7","canonical":"C#7","keyboardPitchClasses":[1,5,8,11],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"Fm7","canonical":"Fm7","keyboardPitchClasses":[5,8,0,3],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"A#m7","canonical":"A#m7","keyboardPitchClasses":[10,1,5,8],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"D7M","canonical":"Dmaj7","keyboardPitchClasses":[2,6,9,1],"interpretation":"Keyboard interpretation: Dmaj7"}],"lines":[{"id":"line-1","kind":"lyric","text":"I'll probably be a waste of your time, but who knows?","columns":54,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C#9","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D#7(9)","column":48,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-2","kind":"lyric","text":"Chances are I'll step out of line, but who knows?","columns":53,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"F#7M","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C#9","column":50,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-3","kind":"lyric","text":"Lately, you've set up in my mind","columns":32,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C#9","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-4","kind":"lyric","text":"Yeah, girl, you, and I like that","columns":47,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"D#7(9)","column":15,"beat":0},{"symbol":"F#m7","column":38,"beat":2},{"symbol":"C#9","column":44,"beat":4}]},{"id":"line-5","kind":"lyric","text":"Lately, I've been thinking that perhaps I am a coward","columns":53,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C#9","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D#7(9)","column":40,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-6","kind":"lyric","text":"Hiding in a disguise of an ever-giving flower","columns":45,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"F#7M","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C#9","column":30,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-7","kind":"lyric","text":"Incompetent steward of all of that sweet, sweet power","columns":71,"beats":8,"changes":[{"symbol":"C#9","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D#7(9)","column":30,"beat":2},{"symbol":"F#m7","column":60,"beat":4},{"symbol":"C#9","column":68,"beat":6}]},{"id":"line-8","kind":"lyric","text":"Yesterday was feeling so good, now it's gone","columns":52,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C#9","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D#7(9)","column":46,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-9","kind":"lyric","text":"I'd feel like that always if I could, is that wrong?","columns":55,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"F#7M","column":4,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C#9","column":52,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-10","kind":"lyric","text":"Tell me 'bout the city you're from","columns":34,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C#9","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-11","kind":"lyric","text":"Is it hot? Does it snow there?","columns":46,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"D#7(9)","column":9,"beat":0},{"symbol":"F#m7","column":37,"beat":2},{"symbol":"C#9","column":43,"beat":4}]},{"id":"line-12","kind":"lyric","text":"Lately, I've been thinking 'bout my precarious future","columns":53,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C#9","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D#7(9)","column":40,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-13","kind":"lyric","text":"Will you be there with me by my side, my girl, my shooter?","columns":58,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"F#7M","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C#9","column":37,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-14","kind":"lyric","text":"Who's to say who calculates? Not me, I'm no computer","columns":68,"beats":8,"changes":[{"symbol":"C#9","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D#7(9)","column":36,"beat":2},{"symbol":"F#m7","column":58,"beat":4},{"symbol":"C#9","column":65,"beat":6}]},{"id":"line-15","kind":"lyric","text":"Is it a crime to be unsure? (Let me know, let me know, let me know, let me)","columns":75,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C#","column":5,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C#7M","column":27,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-16","kind":"lyric","text":"In time we'll find (let me know, let me know, let me know, let me)","columns":66,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C#7","column":18,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-17","kind":"lyric","text":"If it's sustainable (let me know, let me know, let me know, let me)","columns":67,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"F#7M","column":13,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-18","kind":"lyric","text":"You're pure, you're kind (let me know, let me know, let me know, let me)","columns":72,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"F#m7","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-19","kind":"lyric","text":"Mature, divine (let me know, let me know, let me know, let me)","columns":62,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Fm7","column":3,"beat":0},{"symbol":"A#m7","column":11,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-20","kind":"lyric","text":"You might be too good for me, unattainable (let me know, let me know, let me know, let me)","columns":90,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D#7(9)","column":12,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D7M","column":39,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-21","kind":"instrumental","text":"[Interlúdio]","columns":35,"beats":8,"changes":[{"symbol":"C#9","column":13,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D#7(9)","column":18,"beat":2},{"symbol":"F#7M","column":26,"beat":4},{"symbol":"C#9","column":32,"beat":6}]},{"id":"line-22","kind":"instrumental","text":"","columns":36,"beats":8,"changes":[{"symbol":"C#9","column":14,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D#7(9)","column":19,"beat":2},{"symbol":"F#m7","column":27,"beat":4},{"symbol":"C#9","column":33,"beat":6}]},{"id":"line-23","kind":"lyric","text":"Maybe we get married one day, but who knows?","columns":53,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C#9","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D#7(9)","column":47,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-24","kind":"lyric","text":"Think I'll take that thought to the grave, but who knows?","columns":63,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"F#7M","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C#9","column":60,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-25","kind":"lyric","text":"I know that I'll love you always","columns":32,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C#9","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-26","kind":"lyric","text":"Yeah, girl, you, and I'd like that","columns":51,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"D#7(9)","column":15,"beat":0},{"symbol":"F#m7","column":40,"beat":2},{"symbol":"C#9","column":48,"beat":4}]}]}